From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:35:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Research first: holding never blocks loading

QA release point (balance seed 5): planks a Research-first school lacked rode on
past a city in the timber wagons and round the line through the forest, so the
wagons took no logs, nothing was sawn ('no planks sawn for 5 minutes') and the
city sat at 0/22 planks for 70 minutes.

Now goods aren't held for that school in a wagon the train loads on the way
there: a routed train's pickup stops before the school (Later.loads; not a Drop
stop, not a warehouse), a hand-run train's depots before it, the points as they
lie (reachOf, in the order it comes to them). They're dropped where they're
wanted instead, and the engine card says 'Dropping planks here: the wagons are
needed for logs before the school'. The school card's Research first line adds
'unless they need the wagons to load on the way'.

Tests: workshop-unload.test.ts (hand-run and routed fail before; the school
before the forest still keeps them).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
